OL,3,GNEWSABank of England raises interest
OL,4,Arates to 4%, the first increase in more
OL,5,Athan three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank of England raises interest
OL,8,Frates to 4%, the first increase in more
OL,9,Fthan three years
OL,11,FGovernor Andrew Bailey says it
OL,12,Fshouldn't be seen as the first in an
OL,13,F"inevitably long sequence of hikes" -
OL,14,Fbut warns "neither does it seem likely
OL,15,Fto be the last", unless the Iran war is
OL,16,Fresolved
OL,18,FMost economists had expected the move
OL,19,Ffrom the Bank's Monetary Policy
OL,20,FCommittee (MPC) - Faisal Islam looks at
OL,21,Fwhy they have increased rates now and
OL,22,Fhow many more rises we can expect
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
