OL,4,Arates to 4%, the first increase in more
OL,5,Athan three years
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey says the
OL,8,Fgovernment is acting to give "breathing
OL,9,Fspace" to families and businesses; the
OL,10,FTories say "it's time Labour cut taxes,
OL,11,Fwelfare spending and costly
OL,12,Fregulations"
